You've finished the mines and haven't collected any elven daggers
yet?  One of my goals for the mines in the first couple of levels is
to get a quiver of regular daggers, then for the rest of the mines
replace them one by one with elven.  Since wizards can multifire
quivered daggers I think it's worth moving to Expert in them at this
point.

